  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Graham Brown",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::55554307711::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::85ed0aa0-ccfe-11f1-82bb-4d3d627a983b/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "What is your role with Kimberley Quest?\nCaptain\n\nHow would you describe yourself?\nLove adventure, fair and easygoing.\n\nDescribe your role in 10 words or less:\nCreating an itinerary that caters to everyone.\n\nWhat is your favourite aspect of your job?\nThe constant amazing views the Kimberley provides and showcasing everything to our guests.\n\nYour favourite activity and why?\nI don't think I can pick! I love a scenic cruise on KQII, our Jetboat or going out on the tenders!.\n\nWhat is your favourite icon in the Kimberley?\nHorizontal Falls.\n\nYour favourite time of the year and why?\nApril - May, post wet season, as the heat and humidity start to lower with some perfect weather days!\n\nYour favourite meal on board?\nHaha Can I say anything, as I am a bad cook and I can't pass up a fresh fish dinner!\n\nWhat are your favourite hobbies to do when you are on your time off?\nBoating (can't keep me off them) fishing, camping 4wd driving - anything outdoors related."
    },
    {
      "name": "Alex Tom",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::2e5d7490-6666-11f1-8867-f5d9a0bd5cc0/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "What is your role with Kimberley Quest?\nCaptain\n\nHow would you describe yourself?\nAdventurous, easygoing.\n\nDescribe your role in 10 words or less:\nGiving people their dream adventure holiday of a life time.\n\nWhat is your favourite aspect of your job?\nGetting to know everyone from all over Australia & seeing the Kimberley from a whole new perspective.\n\nYour favourite activity and why?\nExploring new places because we may be the first there and fishing for Barramundi.\n\nWhat is your favourite icon in the Kimberley?\nKing George.\n\nYour favourite time of the year and why?\nApril because we go to the north.\n\nYour favourite meal on board?\nPumpkin Pie & Steak night.\n\nWhat are your favourite hobbies to do when you are on your time off?\nCamping & 4wding."
    },
    {
      "name": "Siddharth Murthy (Sid)",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::6455fbd0-6666-11f1-a8da-1547ebbb5f1e/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "What is your role with Kimberley Quest?\nChef\n\nHow would you describe yourself?\nFriendly, curious for new experiences, adventurous to try new things, a peoples person, community focused, keen to discover new food, knowledge, places, people, history, culture.\n\nDescribe your role in 10 words or less:\nMy role is to provide Kimberley Quest guests with the best culinary experience onboard that I can provide, with quality ingredients and local produce. Also exploring new tastes and flavours and the freshest seafood we can catch on a our travels across the Kimberley coast.\n\nWhat is your favourite aspect of your job?\nGuest interaction, guest satisfaction, working with a diverse and fun crew, exploring the Kimberley by sea and working with amazing produce from the Kimberley coastline.\n\nYour favourite activity and why?\nStarting the day watching a beautiful sunrise over the Kimberley coast. It's a sort of reset and recharge for the day ahead.\n\nWhat is your favourite icon in the Kimberley?\nMitchell Falls.\n\nYour favourite time of the year and why?\nWinters in the Kimberley are amazing. Warm sunny days and cool nights.\n\nYour favourite meal on board?\nBreakfast is my favourite meal.\n\nWhat are your favourite hobbies to do when you are on your time off?\nI like to volunteer with local communities. Mainly focusing on my skills of cooking and growing food."
    },
    {
      "name": "Jackson McReady",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::016d4900-6667-11f1-8c77-c33d5e0ddd73/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "What is your role with Kimberley Quest?\nDeckhand / Expedition Guide\n\nHow would you describe yourself?\nAdventurous, curious & passionate!\n\nDescribe your role in 10 words or less:\nHelping deliver the experience of a lifetime!\n\nWhat is your favourite aspect of your job?\nResearching and exploring new places with our amazing guests.\n\nYour favourite activity and why?\nThe next one! Amazing experiences round every corner, but catching a nice Barra or Mackerel is always a good challenge!\n\nWhat is your favourite icon in the Kimberley?\nExperiencing the best sunrise in the world from the incredible Hunter River.\n\nYour favourite time of the year and why?\nMarch - April, incredible waterfalls, lush flora and cool weather.\n\nYour favourite meal on board?\nThe fresh catch of the day.\n\nWhat are your favourite hobbies to do when you are on your time off?\nTravel the world -  Carry on luggage - a one-way ticket - and to go with the flow!"
    },
    {
      "name": "Charles (Charlie) Webb",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::4ff83fd0-6667-11f1-b8bf-b3c730adf391/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "What is your role with Kimberley Quest?\nDeckhand / Expedition Guide\n\nHow would you describe yourself?\nOutgoing, keen to learn, and always ready for dinner!\n\nDescribe your role in 10 words or less:\nA perfect way to explore & share the Kimberley coast.\n\nWhat is your favourite aspect of your job?\nSharing information with people about unique areas... and dinner time!\n\nYour favourite activity and why?\nMontgomery Reef in every aspect - tender - helicopter or experiencing the Sand Cay!\n\nWhat is your favourite icon in the Kimberley?\nTim Willing.\n\nYour favourite time of the year and why?\nOff the back of the wet season, when catchments are full and waterfalls are in full flow.\n\nYour favourite meal on board?\nAll of them!\n\nWhat are your favourite hobbies to do when you are on your time off?\nCamping, drone photography, and amateur bird watching."
    },
    {
      "name": "Luke Macann",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::55554307711::vessel::b236d420-665f-11f1-bb17-c776abae74e5::assets::7028d640-ccfe-11f1-82bb-4d3d627a983b/{imageVariant}",
